title: meetingDiana
position: 136,-238
---
<<set $dianaMet to true>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Despite the sea of UK memorabilia, for the first time tonight you hear an authentic British accent slice through the crowd.][/nomarkup] #line:055b0be 
{$diana}: -love, the answer to your question is no. Get your arse the fuck out of my building. I'm not asking twice.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Diana is dressing down a rowdy patron, but her eyes become transfixed on you as she notices you approach.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You recognize her as the woman from your vision.][/nomarkup]
<<if $toldKieranAboutVision is true>>
    {$kieran}: Another vision?
<<endif>>
[nomarkup][You see Kieran looking at you a little bit confused.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: She was here with me last night. <<if CustomVisited("tellAboutVision") == false>> #line:0a3a355 
<<jump tellAboutVision>> 
===
title: tellAboutVision
---
{$kieran}: Who Diana? She is here every night. That is hardly surprising.
-> {$pcName}: It was more than that.
<<jump approachDiana>>
===
title: approachDiana
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][As you weave through the crowd making your way to the bar, Kieran grabs your shoulder.][/nomarkup] 
{$kieran}: Proceed with caution. Diana is Kate's favorite ghoul. If something were to happen to her, she would be pissed
-> {$pcName}: [nomarkup][Nod.][/nomarkup] #line:0c46c4d 
    {$kieran}: [nomarkup][Kieran nods back.][/nomarkup]
    <<jump dianaApproached>>
-> {$pcName}: I'm not going to hurt her.  #line:02e8b49
    <<if $kevinmurdered == true>>
        {$kieran}: The corpses in your apartment imply otherwise. #line:0a21169 
    <<else>>
        {$kieran}: The corpse in your bathroom implies otherwise.
    <<endif>>
    <<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is true>>
    {$anastasia}: And you think I'm dangerous.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump dianaApproached>>
===
title: dianaApproached
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You whip your head back around to find yourself making direct eye contact with Diana. She clearly wasn't expecting you.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: Hey, how are you? (Composure + Etiquette) #line:050201a 
    <<if Roll("Composure","Etiquette") >=3>>
        <<jump dianaApproachedSuccess>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump dianaApproachedFailure>>
    <<endif>>
-> {$pcName}: Tell me what happened last night?! (Manipulation + Intimidation) #line:0b3a30e 
    <<if Roll("Manipulation","Intimidation") >=3>>
        <<jump dianaThreatenedSuccess>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump dianaThreatenedFailure>>
    <<endif>>
===
title: dianaApproachedSuccess
---
{$diana}: Better than you, I bet. How much do you remember about last night, exactly? #success #line:06d8310 
-> {$pcName}: Enough to know things got pretty crazy. #line:0032d67 
{$diana}: [nomarkup][Chuckling.][/nomarkup] That's a description for it... Absolutely bloody mental is another. Say, want to come to my office for a drink? #line:0c93b0a 
{$diana}: Say, want to come by my office for a drink?
<<set $dianaOffice to true>>
<<jump dianaInvitation>>
===
title: dianaApproachedFailure
---
{$diana}: Sorry, I'm busy right now, luv. Did you lose your wallet or something? Leg it over to the staff in the coat room rather than bothering me with your minor cock-up. #failure #lastline #line:0871d44
<<jump blownOffByDiana>>
===
title: dianaThreatenedSuccess
---
{$diana}: What in the bloody- #success #line:05b323b
{$diana}: Let's take this to my office. I don't field complaints in a public forum. #line:0a48e2c
<<set $dianaOffice to true>>
<<jump dianaInvitation>>
===
title: dianaThreatenedFailure
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The crowd around the bar side-eyes you for making a scene. Everyone is uncomfortable.][/nomarkup] #failure #line:02b6647
{$diana}: Sod off before I have you thrown out. 
<<jump blownOffByDiana>>
===
title: dianaInvitation
---
-> {$pcName}: Sure thing #line:0130b72 
===
title: blownOffByDiana
---
-> {$pcName}: You're not just gonna blow me off!    #line:00f5f4d
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She, in fact, blows you off. Vanishing into the crowd.][/nomarkup] #line:0f325cd
//cut to black, Diana disappears//
===